  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/02/ClubPilotariOndaBsubcampio.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 324px;\" /></p>\n<p>Les finals es van jugar dissabte 10 i diumenge 11 de febrer i l&#39;equip C del Club Pilotari Onda va quedar subcampi&oacute;, en perdre 20-60 contra la Pobla de Vallbona.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/02/EquipsEscolaClubPilotariOnda.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 297px;\" /></p>\n<p>Just abans del partit jugat dissabte a les 18.30 hores es van presentar els equips de l&#39;escola de pilota.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/partidesipresentaciopilota/img_9208.jpg\" alt=\"img_9208\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/partidesipresentaciopilota/img_9211.jpg\" alt=\"img_9211\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/partidesipresentaciopilota/img_9214.jpg\" alt=\"img_9214\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/partidesipresentaciopilota/img_9215.jpg\" alt=\"img_9215\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/partidesipresentaciopilota/img_9219.jpg\" alt=\"img_9219\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/partidesipresentaciopilota/img_9223.jpg\" alt=\"img_9223\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/partidesipresentaciopilota/img_9224.jpg\" alt=\"img_9224\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/partidesipresentaciopilota/img_9225.jpg\" alt=\"img_9225\" style=\"max-wid